# Service account / credentials
*.json
# ...but every seed file under app/data must ship to prod — startup.py reads
# them at boot (pp_seed_manager5.json, setup_times_seed.json, and any future
# sibling). A missing seed file is a SILENT skip, not a crash.
!app/data/*.json

# Dumps / stray env copies
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.uu

# Alembic
alembic/versions/*.pyc
